---
title: "SSD: Approve or Deny Swap (UC-09)"
---
%% new in elab 2. the rules run again here because the schedule
%% can change between the claim and the decision
sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager
    participant System as :System
    Manager->>System: viewPendingSwaps()
    System-->>Manager: claimed swaps, each with a fresh rule check
    Manager->>System: decideSwap(swapId, decision)
    alt approve, and the claimer still passes
        System-->>Manager: approved, shift moved to the claimer
    else approve, but a blocking rule fails now
        System-->>Manager: refused, names the rule
    else deny
        System-->>Manager: denied, shift stays with whoever posted it
    end
